Draft date: 9 November 2026

# A quiet beginning

INT. APARTMENT - DAWN #1#

A kettle clicks off. MARA, 32, stands at the window with two empty cups.

Across the street, a bakery switches on its lights.

MARA
You're early.

ELIAS (O.S.)
I haven't left yet.

She turns. ELIAS, 35, waits in the doorway with a suitcase.

MARA
(looking at the cups)
Coffee?

He puts down the suitcase.

[[Hold on the space between them before the next scene.]]

EXT. BAKERY - MORNING #2#

Mara and Elias sit on the step. Warm bread rests between them.

ELIAS
We could start here.

A bus passes, briefly hiding them from view.

> FADE OUT.
